{
    "title": "Survey Junkie",
    "description": "Survey Junkie is a rewarding, trusted, and fun way to influence brands by sharing what you think through paid surveys. With our app, the power to earn cash is always at your fingertips. Cash-out at $5 via PayPal, bank, or gift cards for Amazon, Visa, Walmart, Apple, Target, Starbucks, and more. Make extra cash to cover more bills, save more, or enjoy more of what you love. We\u2019ve welcomed more than 25 million members to date. Sign up for free and start earning today.\r\n\r\n<b>How does it work?</b> Once you complete your profile, you\u2019ll begin to receive survey matches. New matches will hit your survey feed daily. Your account will be credited for successful survey completes and you\u2019ll even earn a few points for unsuccessful attempts. On average, members who complete three surveys daily earn around $40 monthly.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s how to make the most of your Survey Junkie membership:\r\n\r\n<b>Stay on track.</b> Set your earning goal.\r\n<b>Start with 3.</b> Take at least 3 surveys daily.\r\n<b>Score a monthly bonus.</b> Complete our $5 Rewards Boosts.\r\n<b>Start surfing.</b> Unlock exclusive, higher-paying surveys with our Surf to Earn feature.\r\n\r\nWhat is Surf to Earn?\r\n\r\nUsing Accessibility Services, Surf to Earn gathers information about online searches, site visits, app usage, shopping activity, and ad views. These everyday online activities help marketers understand the way you experience brands online, so they can enhance the way you experience their brand in your life. It\u2019s information you already share with search engines, online retailers, and social media platforms - the difference is Survey Junkie rewards you for it.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Who can become a member?</b>\r\nTo become a member, you must be 18 years or older and reside in the United States, Canada, Australia, or the United Kingdom.\r\n<b>\ud83d\ude4b How does it work?</b>\r\nGet started and earn 100 points before you complete your first official survey!\r\n1. <b>Download our app and create an account</b> (+25 points)\r\nSigning up is simple. Just provide some basic information such as your name, email, zip code, and date of birth.\r\n2. <b>Confirm your email address</b> (+25 points)\r\nAfter signing up, check your inbox and confirm your email address.\r\n3. <b>Complete your profile</b> (+50 points)\r\nWhen you log in, you\u2019ll see a profile questionnaire. Fill this out to increase our app\u2019s survey-matching accuracy.\r\n4. <b>Check daily survey matches</b>\r\nSurveys appear on your feed and in your preferred notifications. Each survey includes a point value and estimated completion time.\r\n5. <b>Take surveys</b>\r\nSuccessful survey completes are rewarded with associated points and you\u2019ll even earn a few points for unsuccessful attempts.\r\n6. <b>Cashout begins at 500 points</b>\r\nOnce you reach 500 points or $5, you can redeem for cash through PayPal or gift cards from Amazon, Walmart, Visa, Target, Starbucks, Sephora, and Apple Store. The more surveys you complete, the more you earn.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udc40 What you should know</b>\r\n- Set yourself up for success by taking your time and providing accurate answers. This helps to decrease the chance of disqualification and ensures brands gather trustworthy insights.\r\n- Since brands need input from a particular type of person, someone they intend to reach with their product or service, not everyone qualifies for every survey.\r\n- Oftentimes, you\u2019ll be taken to a partner site which may require additional screening to determine if you\u2019re eligible and feature a different interface. This is typical.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd12 Is it safe?</b>\r\nWe enable you to take control of your information and harness its value. Your information is securely encrypted and shared in a privacy-compliant way that enables brands to create insights about their audiences.\r\n\r\nFor more information, visit the Survey Junkie privacy policy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Survey Junkie is a rewarding, trusted, and fun way to influence brands by sharing what you think through paid surveys. With our app, the power to earn cash is always at your fingertips. Cash-out at $5 via PayPal, bank, or gift cards for Amazon, Visa, Walmart, Apple, Target, Starbucks, and more. Make extra cash to cover more bills, save more, or enjoy more of what you love. We\u2019ve welcomed more than 25 million members to date. Sign up for free and start earning today.<br><br><b>How does it work?</b> Once you complete your profile, you\u2019ll begin to receive survey matches. New matches will hit your survey feed daily. Your account will be credited for successful survey completes and you\u2019ll even earn a few points for unsuccessful attempts. On average, members who complete three surveys daily earn around $40 monthly.<br><br>Here\u2019s how to make the most of your Survey Junkie membership:<br><br><b>Stay on track.</b> Set your earning goal.<br><b>Start with 3.</b> Take at least 3 surveys daily.<br><b>Score a monthly bonus.</b> Complete our $5 Rewards Boosts.<br><b>Start surfing.</b> Unlock exclusive, higher-paying surveys with our Surf to Earn feature.<br><br>What is Surf to Earn?<br><br>Using Accessibility Services, Surf to Earn gathers information about online searches, site visits, app usage, shopping activity, and ad views. These everyday online activities help marketers understand the way you experience brands online, so they can enhance the way you experience their brand in your life. It\u2019s information you already share with search engines, online retailers, and social media platforms - the difference is Survey Junkie rewards you for it.<br><br><b>\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Who can become a member?</b><br>To become a member, you must be 18 years or older and reside in the United States, Canada, Australia, or the United Kingdom.<br><b>\ud83d\ude4b How does it work?</b><br>Get started and earn 100 points before you complete your first official survey!<br>1. <b>Download our app and create an account</b> (+25 points)<br>Signing up is simple. Just provide some basic information such as your name, email, zip code, and date of birth.<br>2. <b>Confirm your email address</b> (+25 points)<br>After signing up, check your inbox and confirm your email address.<br>3. <b>Complete your profile</b> (+50 points)<br>When you log in, you\u2019ll see a profile questionnaire. Fill this out to increase our app\u2019s survey-matching accuracy.<br>4. <b>Check daily survey matches</b><br>Surveys appear on your feed and in your preferred notifications. Each survey includes a point value and estimated completion time.<br>5. <b>Take surveys</b><br>Successful survey completes are rewarded with associated points and you\u2019ll even earn a few points for unsuccessful attempts.<br>6. <b>Cashout begins at 500 points</b><br>Once you reach 500 points or $5, you can redeem for cash through PayPal or gift cards from Amazon, Walmart, Visa, Target, Starbucks, Sephora, and Apple Store. The more surveys you complete, the more you earn.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udc40 What you should know</b><br>- Set yourself up for success by taking your time and providing accurate answers. This helps to decrease the chance of disqualification and ensures brands gather trustworthy insights.<br>- Since brands need input from a particular type of person, someone they intend to reach with their product or service, not everyone qualifies for every survey.<br>- Oftentimes, you\u2019ll be taken to a partner site which may require additional screening to determine if you\u2019re eligible and feature a different interface. This is typical.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udd12 Is it safe?</b><br>We enable you to take control of your information and harness its value. Your information is securely encrypted and shared in a privacy-compliant way that enables brands to create insights about their audiences.<br><br>For more information, visit the Survey Junkie privacy policy.",
